        "TileImage": "$($repository 57414fad-32e4-44bc-8e7f-06289891f35e).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47,\r\rThat time has come once again; the ICA is ready to spread some more SMG (so much goodness.) Five more fortunate individuals have been selected to recieve your generosity. Just as last time, deliver each blessing swiftly, quietly, and in your finest suit. The ICA very much appreciates your charitable spirit. \r\rGood Gifting, 47.\r\r-The International Contract Agency\r\r*CONFIDENTIAL*",
